AM2R GX — a Wii port of AM2R 1.5.5 (Community Update) on the Butterscotch engine.

AM2R GX is free software under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 (LICENSE.txt).
Its complete source, including every patch applied to the engine, is at
https://github.com/cmyksoda/AM2R-GX

No game data ships with it: the player supplies their own copy of AM2R 1.1, and the console builds
1.5.5 from it with the AM2R Community Developers' patch. AM2R GX is not affiliated with Nintendo,
YoYo Games, DoctorM64 or the AM2R Community Developers.

The patch/ folder holds the AM2R Community Developers' 1.5.5 patch data from their AM2R Autopatcher,
which they distribute under the GNU General Public License v3.0 (patch/LICENSE.txt). The delta is
re-encoded to fit the console's memory; it yields the same 1.5.5 data.win.

